From: tene11 <tene11@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:34:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Harden the Cleanroom download and install

- Only accept download URLs of the CleanroomMC/Cleanroom GitHub releases
  over HTTPS.
- Reject component uids from the downloaded zip that could be used as a
  path (they become patches/<uid>.json).
- When removing Cleanroom, only delete plain "<name>.jar" stub files
  from the instance's library folder.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013JsFfD4B8pB33N2PvMGY8s
